  "details": "<p>Barrington Atlas follows Rivet &amp; Smith by identifying Victoria with modern Inchtuthil, and Bannatia with Dalginross. Frere rather persuasively equates Inchtuthil with Pinnata Castra, and with less certainty suggests that Victoria is modern day Dalginross. RCAHMS tentatively accepts Frere's view.</p>",
